title: "Physics-Informed Cost-and-Boundary-Aware Deep Imitation Learning for Residential EV Charging in Solar Prosumer Systems"
abstract: "Deep imitation learning framework for residential electric vehicle charging in solar prosumer systems embedding normalized electricity tariffs and battery State-of-Charge boundary penalties directly into neural backpropagation."
